2026-10-19T00:32:12.0522838Z [36;1m# The baseline lives at the PROJECT root, which is NOT the workspace root for a[0m
2026-10-19T00:32:12.0523662Z [36;1m# consumer that sets `working-directory` -- stranske/Travel-Plan-Permission really does.[0m
2026-10-19T00:32:12.0524460Z [36;1m# Those consumers were reading a path that does not exist, and an unread baseline used[0m
2026-10-19T00:32:12.0525217Z [36;1m# to render as 0.00% with a delta measured against nothing. Workspace root is kept as a[0m
2026-10-19T00:32:12.0525963Z [36;1m# fallback so the `working-directory: "."` consumers (every other repo in the fleet)[0m
2026-10-19T00:32:12.0526622Z [36;1m# resolve to exactly the same file as before.[0m
2026-10-19T00:32:12.0527183Z [36;1mBASELINE_PATH="${PROJECT_ROOT}/config/coverage-baseline.json"[0m
2026-10-19T00:32:12.0527706Z [36;1mif [ ! -f "${BASELINE_PATH}" ]; then[0m
